# Rust build artifacts
/target

# Working notes. Private by DEFAULT: `/plans/*` ignores everything under it, and
# a document is published only by being listed below. The gate (plan item 0.1) is
# per file — publish a document when nothing in it maps a defect that is still
# exploitable. New notes stay ignored until someone makes that call explicitly.
/plans/*
!/plans/00-first-step.md
!/plans/BUILD.md
!/plans/CHANGE-LOG-DESIGN.md
!/plans/CLUSTER.md
!/plans/COMMANDS.md
!/plans/DESIGN-PRINCIPLES.md
!/plans/DIFFERENTIATORS.md
!/plans/GEO-DESIGN.md
!/plans/HARD-PARTS.md
!/plans/IMPROVEMENTS.md
!/plans/INTEGRATION.md
!/plans/LANDSCAPE.md
!/plans/PRODUCTION-READINESS.md
!/plans/README.md
!/plans/REFERENCE.md
!/plans/ROADMAP.md

# Persistence files written at runtime
*.rdb
*.rdb.tmp
*.aof

# Backups / editor / OS cruft
erl_crash.dump
**/*.rs.bk
*.swp
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# Note: Cargo.lock IS committed (this is a binary application).
